"Too many pages to move.  Since Linux 2.6.29, the kernel no longer generates "
"this error."
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man2/move_pages.2:180
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EACCES>"
msgstr ""

#.  FIXME Clarify "current cpuset" in the description of the EACCES error.
